 r←Test_Misc_031(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;config;successFlag;msg
⍝ Exercise `PerformConfigChecks`: a missing "SYSVARS" section must be reported.
⍝ Used to crash with a VALUE ERROR right after detecting that the section is missing.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 config←∆GetConfigForChecks'packages_dev'
 config.⎕EX'SYSVARS'
 (successFlag msg)←##.Cider.PerformConfigChecks config
 →T.PassesIf 0≡successFlag
 →T.PassesIf∨/'"SYSVARS" is missing'⍷msg

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
